cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this work, please cite it as below.
title: "Fixed windows for independent prime weights"
abstract: "For either the 547/727 or the 571/599 prime-ideal race, independence of compact continuous prime weights is equivalent to a fixed interior ball of convex score averages after every height in one multiplicative window. The numerical affine forecast errors hold with a uniform deadline on rational-prime-power starts."
